- ```tabular
+ ```tabular

- column  Calibration
- column  Positions
- column  Range
- row  `linearCalibration`  linear  padded outward to whole gradations; the default
- row  `logarithmicCalibration`  logarithmic, or linear when the data reaches zero  whole decades
